WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.491
Eddy raced after Poppy.

2
00:00:06.492 --> 00:00:10.397
"Poppy, wait!" he cried.

3
00:00:10.398 --> 00:00:13.014
Eddy shot in front of her.

4
00:00:13.015 --> 00:00:16.838
"Let's practice now!" he said.

5
00:00:16.839 --> 00:00:19.958
"No!" said Poppy.

6
00:00:19.959 --> 00:00:23.294
Poppy backed up fast.

7
00:00:23.295 --> 00:00:28.103
She tried to go around Eddy.

8
00:00:28.104 --> 00:00:31.754
Eddy blocked her way.

9
00:00:31.755 --> 00:00:36.118
Poppy backed up again.

10
00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:39.043
Poppy turned.

11
00:00:39.044 --> 00:00:43.287
Then she gasped.

12
00:00:43.288 --> 00:00:49.593
She was next to the curb.

13
00:00:49.594 --> 00:00:56.673
"I did it!" cried Poppy.

14
00:00:56.674 --> 00:00:59.646
"Thanks, Eddy!"

15
00:00:59.647 --> 00:01:03.856
"You're welcome," said Eddy.

16
00:01:03.857 --> 00:01:07.695
"I'm sorry I didn't help before.

17
00:01:07.696 --> 00:01:12.234
Zippy made me so mad."

18
00:01:12.235 --> 00:01:20.845
"It's okay," said Poppy.

19
00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:24.882
"Test time!" called Ms. Fender.

20
00:01:24.883 --> 00:01:38.068
Everyone took the parking test.

21
00:01:38.069 --> 00:01:42.394
"Yay!" Poppy shouted.

22
00:01:42.395 --> 00:01:49.625
"I passed the test!"

23
00:01:49.626 --> 00:01:52.798
Zippy's wheel hit the curb.

24
00:01:52.799 --> 00:01:55.959
"Ugh," he said.

25
00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.986
"I failed!"

26
00:01:58.987 --> 00:02:02.436
Ms. Fender smiled.

27
00:02:02.437 --> 00:02:08.609
"Keep practicing, Zippy!"

